{"question": "kg-decision-llm", "strategy": "cards", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "effort": null, "answer": {"answer": "No. kg never calls an LLM itself and needs no API keys (decision:no-embedded-llm, RF-24, which justifies package:kg). External agents (e.g. Claude Code, Codex) read the documents and decide on decisions/concepts; they follow the guide shipped in package kg.agents (`kg guide`, exportable as the kg-graph skill with `kg guide --skill`), write a JSON document valid against the schema with provenance method 'llm', and send it to kg with `kg add` (kg.cli._add -> kg.merge.add_to_store), which validates it and merges it into the .kg/ store by ID. When merging, parser provenance wins over llm/manual provenance (decision:parser-wins-over-llm), so enrichment cannot overwrite deterministic extracted data.", "items": [], "evidence": ["decision:no-embedded-llm", "decision:no-embedded-llm -[justifies]-> package:kg", "docs/requirements.md:144", "package:kg.agents", "src/kg/agents/__init__.py:1-20", "function:kg.agents.skill_text", "function:kg.merge.add_to_store", "function:kg.cli._add", "decision:parser-wins-over-llm", "decision:parser-wins-over-llm -[justifies]-> module:kg.merge", "concept:merge-by-id"]}, "outcome": "answered", "turns": 13, "tool_calls": 12, "tool_errors": 1, "context_chars": 7638, "seconds": 50.26, "usage": {"total_tokens": 33218}, "repo": "kg", "topic": "decisions", "grade": {"score": 1.0, "precision": null, "recall": null, "missing": [], "extra": []}, "traceability": 1.0, "calls": ["kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "submit_answer"], "config": {"runner": "subagent", "max_turns": 25, "strategies": ["cards"], "questions": "bench/questions/main.json", "repos": {"basic-python-cli": "d0379bb", "kg": "1a342c4", "kg-stale": "1a342c4", "my_first_data_project": "3d57177", "python-clean-architecture": "6f58de5"}, "kg": "kg 0.1.0.dev0", "kg_commit": "bec704e"}}
